{@inviter.email} has requested to transfer the ownership of {@site.domain} site on {Plausible.product_name()} to you. Please accept the request within 48 hours.
<%= if @new_owner_account do %>
  <a href={url(~p"/sites")}>Click here</a> to view and respond to the invitation.
<% else %>
  <a
    phx-no-format
    href={url(~p"/register/invitation/#{@invitation_id}")}
  >Click here</a> to create your account. <br /><br />
  Plausible is a lightweight and open-source website analytics tool. We hope you like our simple and ethical approach to tracking website visitors.
<% end %>
